  "summary": "Validating Matrix key IDs may panic",
  "details": "Using `key_id::validate` may panic if the `algorithm` part of the key ID is\nlonger than 255 bytes and contains non-ASCII characters. The affected versions\nassumed that the length of the first part containing the encryption or signing\nalgorithm (the part before the colon) would fit into a `NonZeroU8`, but the\nlength of the first part wasn't validated.",
